OL,3,GNEWSAHunt to find 400-tonne waste dump
OL,4,Aculprits
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal waste dumped near an airport
OL,7,Fand weighing an estimated 400 tonnes is
OL,8,Fbeing sifted through in an attempt to
OL,9,Fidentify those responsible for it.
OL,11,FOfficers from the Environment Agency
OL,12,F(EA) are searching the commercial waste
OL,13,Fat Callerton Hill, near Newcastle
OL,14,FAirport, which is one of three major
OL,15,Ffly-tipping sites discovered in
OL,16,Fnorth-east England this summer
OL,17,Falongside ones in Hartlepool and
OL,18,FPeterlee.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
