OL,3,GNEWSAHunt to find 400-tonne waste dump
OL,4,Aculprits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EA's crime team said there had been
OL,7,F"large-scale industrial dumping" and
OL,8,Fwarned landowners were responsible for
OL,9,Ffooting the clean-up bill.
OL,11,FThe agency's Mark Rumble said the items
OL,12,Ffound in Newcastle had probably come
OL,13,Ffrom a waste processing facility.
